{"t":"Key 4601","s":"key-4601-06ea2","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Copper_Key_a0bf0e.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"number\">Key 4601</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Copper Key\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Copper_Key_a0bf0e.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Silver Key\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Key_57723b.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also Known As</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bear Room Key</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"primarytype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Item Class</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Copper Key, Silver Key </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.00 oz.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"origin\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Origin</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Can be found in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest\">Chest</a> near the <a href=\"#/quest/bear-room-quest\">Bear Room</a> after revealing a hole with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a> located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32149,32111,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32149, 32111, 11)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"shortnotes\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Notes</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Key to the <a href=\"#/quest/bear-room-quest\">Bear Room</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Loot value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>(not bought by NPCs)</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>(not sold by NPCs)</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Keys <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-key-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This key is found <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32150,32112,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32150, 32112, 12)</a> and allows you to enter the Bear Room, site of the <a href=\"#/quest/bear-room-quest\">Bear Room Quest</a>, on <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>. The room contains some valuable items. You will need a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a> to obtain this key.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-key-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Sometime before Update 7.0, a silver version of this key, which is now considered very rare, used to spawn in a place close to where the copper version can now be found.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Keys\">Related Keys</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Copper_Keys\">Copper Keys</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Key 0001</li><li>Key 0020</li><li>Key 0022</li><li>Key 0101</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\">Key 3012</a></li><li>Key 3015</li><li>Key 3100</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203142\">Key 3142</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203301\">Key 3301</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203303\">Key 3303</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203800\">Key 3800</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203801\">Key 3801</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203802\">Key 3802</a></li><li>Key 3803</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203899\">Key 3899</a></li><li>Key 3900</li><li>Key 3901</li><li>Key 3902</li><li>Key 3909</li><li>Key 3910</li><li>Key 3911</li><li>Key 3912</li><li>Key 3913</li><li>Key 3914</li><li>Key 3915</li><li>Key 3916</li><li>Key 3917</li><li>Key 3923</li><li>Key 3925</li><li>Key 3930</li><li>Key 3931</li><li>Key 3932</li><li>Key 3933</li><li>Key 3934</li><li>Key 3935</li><li>Key 3936</li><li>Key 3937</li><li>Key 3938</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203940\">Key 394